{
  "title": "Roleta Cloud — DNA 3 Regioes (SP-19)",
  "uid": "roleta-dna-regions",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "wheel_dist percentis (1h)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "roleta_wheel_dist_p50_1h", "legendFormat": "p50" },
        { "expr": "roleta_wheel_dist_p95_1h", "legendFormat": "p95" },
        { "expr": "roleta_wheel_dist_p99_1h", "legendFormat": "p99" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "calibration_error fill rate (NEW-12)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "roleta_calibration_fill_rate_1h" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": 0 }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.8 }, { "color": "green", "value": 0.95 }] } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "DNA realize lag (s)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "roleta_dna_realize_lag_seconds" }],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": 0 }, { "color": "yellow", "value": 120 }, { "color": "red", "value": 300 }] } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "DNA unrealized count",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "roleta_dna_unrealized_count" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "wheel_dist samples / 1h",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 4 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "roleta_wheel_dist_samples_1h" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "DNA summary por (feature, bucket) — consultar /api/dna_summary",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**SP-09 endpoint:** `GET http://<host>:8766/api/dna_summary`\n\nRetorna agregado por (feature_name, bucket) com `n`, `hit_rate`, `avg_lift_pp`, `avg_wheel_dist`. Features esperadas:\n- `sda_score` (sweet_spot/high/low) — SP-07\n- `calibration_offset` — SP-07\n- `tr_c4_rate` (hot/warm/cold) — SP-07\n- `kill_v4` (on/off) — SP-07\n- `region_C1/C2/C3` (zero/near/far) — SP-17 REGION-02\n\n**SP-08:** `dna_realize_lifts()` calcula `realized_lift_pp` em lote — rodar via cron ou no boot."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Accuracy rolling 100 (CW vs CCW)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "roleta_recent_acc_cw", "legendFormat": "CW" },
        { "expr": "roleta_recent_acc_ccw", "legendFormat": "CCW" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "KILL v4 pulls (cumulativo)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 12 },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "roleta_kill_pulls_total" }]
    }
  ]
}
